Abstract = {To present clearer and more significant boundary conditions for
   architecture and urban design which takes energy and environment as the
   key points, and offer valid references for higher energy efficiency
   during the city development, based on related urban physical environment
   theories, according to the present situation of local climates and
   environments of the cities in China, the paper provides classifications
   of the city underlay surface materials, building properties, natural
   elements and other environmental influence factors, and analyses various
   physical and ecological effects derived from the factors. It also points
   out that the digital integrated map system including urban local
   climates, energy consumption, and reference recommendations can be
