   Tourism Chamber Commerce; Lingnan Int Grp; Chime Long Grp; Hengda Hotel
   Management Grp; Amer Scholar Press; Jinan Univ, Alumni Assoc},
Abstract = {With BPNP, Mt. Danxia and Mt. Dinghu as the representatives of vertical,
   localization and inter-checking models of national park management
   respectively, the present research analyzes and compares managerial
   personnel's perceptions towards natural resources management subsumed
   under a variety of park management systems of different countries. The
   paper applies the IPA methodology and uses park managerial personnel as
   the object of study, collecting necessary data by means of
   questionnaire. The primary probe into the field demonstrates that the
   personnel's reflective demand on the management of natural resources in
   the three national parks of BPNP, Mt. Dinghu and Mt. Danxia ranks in a
   descending way, which bespeaks the impact of external supervision on the
   perceptions of park managerial personnel, giving rise to the fact that a
   stronger managerial supervisor is also the constructor of a higher
   standard of management.},
