   Engineering (ICCAHE 2013), Zhuhai, PEOPLES R CHINA, JUL 27-28, 2013},
Abstract = {This article described the operations of measurement, calculation and
   analysis of the cooling effect field of Shangcheng Park, the green space
   in Erqi Square Center of Zhengzhou City. This program is carried out in
   four steps. Firstly, the high-vegetation-quantity-area center was
   confirmed as the center point of the green space, and observation points
   and a reference one were also be identified. Secondly, field observation
   with instruments conducted and the data were kept records. Thirdly,
   Excel software was used to calculate the average daily temperature and
   the cooling rate of the green space. At last, analysis was given on the
   result of the operation. The results of Shangcheng Park study show that
   the cooling effect field of the green space has a radius of more than
   60m, and distributes regularly.},
