   applied for the municipalities of the Thessaloniki Urban Area in
   Northern Greece. Specifically, a set of 4 evaluation indicators is
   examined and calculated for each municipality while the
   multiple-criteria method of Analytic Hierarchy Process is finally
   applied to globally rank the considered municipalities. As a result, a
   classification of all examined municipalities is derived and various
   conclusions are drawn on the efficiency and effectiveness of the waste
   collection systems.},
