   Exchange Serv Fdn; German Embassy Ghana},
Abstract = {When the promotion pattern is established, retail advertisers will face
   the problem to deliver promotion information in some ways, that is, how
   to express the ads and to communicate with customers. Large number of
   studies have proved that for two identical promotions, different
   expression of such information will lead to different perception of
   trading values and thereby the disparity of ultimate effect of the two
   cases. The purpose of this study is to discuss the effectiveness of
