   maintenance strategies implemented in healthcare facilities. The aim of
   this paper is to provide an overview of types of maintenance strategy
   applied to maintain facilities while satisfying the end user. Interviews
   and surveys were conducted to generate data from facility managers and
   end users in selected hospitals. The results show that there is a
   relationship between types of maintenance strategy implemented and end
   user satisfaction. Null Hypothesis was rejected due to the level of
   significant p>0.05 and p>0.01. (C) 2015 The Authors. Published by
