Title = {EXPLORING THE RELATIONSHIPS BETWEEN LAND SURFACE TEMPERATURE, GROUND
   COVERAGE RATIO AND BUILDING VOLUME DENSITY IN AN URBANIZED ENVRONMENT},
Booktitle = {36TH INTERNATIONAL SYMPOSIUM ON REMOTE SENSING OF ENVIRONMENT},
