Abstract = {At NPA we have investigated a variety of ground displacement phenomena
   using our CivlnSAR differential interferometric system, as part of our
   BNSC ADP2 programme. We report here a spectacular case of major urban
   subsidence, over a 100km(2) area amounting to 78mm over almost 3 years.
